</span><span class="x1lliihq">It will be <a href="mailto:info@divineautomation.co.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" dir="ltr" class="_ao3e selectable-text copyable-text x1bvjpef x1lku1pv x11iimpl xbvygy2 x1wp9yj1 x1e2wovf x1ph7ams x17f7hit xn69kzl xrys4gj xhmieyt xtnn1bt x9v5kkp xmw7ebm xrdum7p" title="mailto:info@divineautomation.co.in">info@divineautomation.co.in</a>
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">5)Since one space is vacant we will add 4th video of Mig welding of furniture sofa sets arm rest and legs where two parts are fused by Mig welding without any electrodes using Japanese OTC Robots.
</span><span class="">Video is attached below.</span></span><span class=""><span class="x3nfvp2 xxymvpz xlshs6z xqtp20y xexx8yu x1uc92m x18d9i69 x181vq82 x12lo8hy x152skdk" aria-hidden="true"><span class="x1c4vz4f x2lah0s">4:52 pm</span></span></span></div></div><div class="x1n2onr6 x1n327nk x18mqm2i xhsvlbd x14z9mp xz62fqu x1wbi8v6"><div class="x1bvqhpb xx3o462 xuxw1ft x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x12lo8hy x152skdk"><span class="x1rg5ohu x16dsc37" dir="auto"><span class="x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs xt0psk2 x1fj9vlw xhslqc4 x1hx0egp x1pg5gke xjb2p0i xo1l8bm xl2ypbo x1ic7a3i" style="--x-fontSize: 12px; --x-lineHeight: 8.5313px;">4:52 pm</span></span></div></div></div></div><span class=""></span><div class="_amlr"></div></div><div class="x1c4vz4f xs83m0k xdl72j9 x1g77sc7 x78zum5 xozqiw3 x1oa3qoh x12fk4p8 xeuugli x2lwn1j x1nhvcw1 x1q0g3np x6s0dn4 _amj_"><div class="x1c4vz4f xs83m0k xdl72j9 x1g77sc7 xeuugli x2lwn1j xozqiw3 x1oa3qoh x12fk4p8 xexx8yu x1im30kd x18d9i69 x1djpfga"><div></div></div></div></div><div class="x78zum5 xbfrwjf x8k05lb xeq5yr9 x1n2onr6 xrr41r3 xqcrz7y"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div tabindex="-1" class="" role="row"><div tabindex="-1" class="_amjv xa0aww2" data-id="false_918814930229@c.us_A533778C4D070CBB1EE73CFF2BD5C55D"><div class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf" data-virtualized="false"><div class=""><div class="message-in focusable-list-item _amjy _amjz _amjw x1klvx2g xahtqtb"><span class=""></span><div class="_amk4 false _amkd false"><div class="_amk6 _amlo false false"><div><div class="x9f619 x1hx0egp x1yrsyyn xizg8k xu9hqtb xwib8y2"><div class="xe9ewy2"><span aria-hidden="true" data-icon="forward-refreshed" class="x1rg5ohu x16dsc37 xhslqc4"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="16" width="16" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" class="" fill="none"><title>forward-refreshed</title><path d="M19.175 11L15.3 7.12505C15.1 6.92505 15 6.68755 15 6.41255C15 6.13755 15.1 5.90005 15.3 5.70005C15.5 5.51672 15.7375 5.42505 16.0125 5.42505C16.2875 5.42505 16.5167 5.51672 