</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">and Allen Bradley by Delta SCARA Robots.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">7)In projects..
</span><span class="x1lliihq">Sunden Ltd. HVAC system measures air volume also passed through Anemometer.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="">8)In Projects please add that we have till now commissioned 225 Robotic installations in Maruti,JBM,Caparo,Tata,Sunbeam ,Amtek and Raunaq Auto.</span></span><span class=""><span class="x3nfvp2 xxymvpz xlshs6z xqtp20y xexx8yu x1uc92m x18d9i69 x181vq82 x12lo8hy x152skdk" aria-hidden="true"><span class="x1c4vz4f x2lah0s">4:52 pm</span></span></span></div></div><div class="x1n2onr6 x1n327nk x18mqm2i xhsvlbd x14z9mp xz62fqu x1wbi8v6"><div class="x1bvqhpb xx3o462 xuxw1ft x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x12lo8hy x152skdk"><span class="x1rg5ohu x16dsc37" dir="auto"><span class="x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs xt0psk2 x1fj9vlw xhslqc4 x1hx0egp x1pg5gke xjb2p0i xo1l8bm xl2ypbo x1ic7a3i" style="--x-fontSize: 12px; --x-lineHeight: 8.5313px;">4:52 pm</span></span></div></div></div></div><span class=""></span><div class="_amlr"></div></div><div class="x1c4vz4f xs83m0k xdl72j9 x1g77sc7 x78zum5 xozqiw3 x1oa3qoh x12fk4p8 xeuugli x2lwn1j x1nhvcw1 x1q0g3np x6s0dn4 _amj_"><div class="x1c4vz4f xs83m0k xdl72j9 x1g77sc7 xeuugli x2lwn1j xozqiw3 x1oa3qoh x12fk4p8 xexx8yu x1im30kd x18d9i69 x1djpfga"><div></div></div></div></div><div class="x78zum5 xbfrwjf x8k05lb xeq5yr9 x1n2onr6 xrr41r3 xqcrz7y"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div tabindex="-1" class="" role="row"><div tabindex="-1" class="_amjv xa0aww2" data-id="false_918814930229@c.us_A5B52027485736A630CB3B6C0CD609F5"><div class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf" data-virtualized="false"><div class=""><div class="message-in focusable-list-item _amjy _amjz _amjw x1klvx2g xahtqtb"><span class=""></span><div class="_amk4 false _amkd false"><div class="_amk6 _amlo false false"><div><div class="x9f619 x1hx0egp x1yrsyyn xizg8k xu9hqtb xwib8y2"><div class="xe9ewy2"><span aria-hidden="true" data-icon="forward-refreshed" class="x1rg5ohu x16dsc37 xhslqc4"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="16" width="16" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" class="" fill="none"><title>forward-refreshed</title><path d="M19.175 11L15.3 7.12505C15.1 6.92505 15 6.68755 15 6.4